WEBVTT

00:00:09.230 --> 00:00:10.300
Yuni!

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:12.610
Thank goodness! You're finally awake!

00:00:14.120 --> 00:00:14.780
Hey...

00:00:18.690 --> 00:00:20.140
You shouldn't be moving yet.

00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:21.000
Your wound will open.

00:00:21.830 --> 00:00:25.740
This is... the Excessarca's infirmary?

00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:29.000
I can't be here... I need to 
get back to the front lines!

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:31.960
Calm down. The battle's over.

00:00:31.960 --> 00:00:36.890
We're mustering our remaining forces 
and falling back to Hariant.

00:00:37.820 --> 00:00:40.560
Then the defense line on the River Deese...

00:00:41.860 --> 00:00:42.850
Yeah...

00:00:42.850 --> 00:00:46.440
There was a full day of fighting, 
and the Imperial Army broke through.

00:00:48.390 --> 00:00:50.450
I don't like it either,

00:00:51.340 --> 00:00:54.560
but you should focus on 
your recovery for now.

00:00:55.750 --> 00:00:56.590
Lune...

00:00:57.390 --> 00:00:59.660
We'll have one last showdown in Hariant.

00:01:00.020 --> 00:01:02.950
C'mon... let's show them 
our passion and will.

00:01:19.890 --> 00:01:22.140
The Price of Smiles

00:01:19.890 --> 00:01:22.140
<i>The Price of Smiles</i>

00:02:36.760 --> 00:02:42.430
<b><i>The Crossroads of Fate</i></b>

00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:44.170
<i>People of Hariant.</i>

00:02:44.170 --> 00:02:47.520
<i>Please follow the instructions 
given to you calmly but quickly.</i>

00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:53.520
<i>The Kingdom will bring you all 
safely to the evacuation site.</i>

00:02:53.850 --> 00:02:58.530
<i>We will overcome this hardship, 
and smile together again some day.</i>

00:02:58.800 --> 00:03:02.530
<i>I, Yuki Soleil, believe this 
from the bottom of my heart.</i>

00:03:02.870 --> 00:03:07.270
<i>Everyone, please prioritize your 
safety over everything else.</i>

00:03:07.850 --> 00:03:10.540
<i>I'll be keeping you all in my thoughts.</i>

00:03:11.820 --> 00:03:16.210
Princess Yuki... she volunteered 
for that painful duty.

00:03:16.210 --> 00:03:17.970
But it was worth it.

00:03:17.970 --> 00:03:20.550
There has been no panic among 
the citizens as a result.

00:03:21.440 --> 00:03:25.710
Will the war finally come 
to our city of Hariant?

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:29.660
How's Elisa? Has she left 
the city with Noel yet?

00:03:30.320 --> 00:03:31.110
No...

00:03:32.280 --> 00:03:33.880
You did well.

00:03:33.880 --> 00:03:37.160
You should leave things to the others 
now, and go rest in your room.

00:03:37.730 --> 00:03:41.820
Miss Layla... is there really 
no way to avoid more fighting?

00:03:42.180 --> 00:03:44.320
I'm afraid not.

00:03:45.030 --> 00:03:49.330
What if I surrender, and turn 
myself over to the Empire?

00:03:49.560 --> 00:03:53.540
The people do not wish to sacrifice you.

00:03:54.030 --> 00:03:58.840
And it will be all the more torturous for 
them if we're occupied by the Empire.

00:04:00.550 --> 00:04:04.840
Then, you're saying there's 
nothing else I can do?

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:11.230
It was the same back then... in Leash.

00:04:12.010 --> 00:04:16.370
I just wanted to save the 
people left in the city...

00:04:16.790 --> 00:04:19.860
But I couldn't do anything... except watch...

00:04:20.210 --> 00:04:22.820
What am I... as princess...

00:04:37.320 --> 00:04:38.680
Papa!

00:04:39.120 --> 00:04:41.090
Noel! You really came?

00:04:41.660 --> 00:04:45.090
Yeah! I kept Mama and the baby safe!

00:04:45.420 --> 00:04:48.310
I see, thank you.
That's very brave of you.

00:04:52.300 --> 00:04:55.260
Please reconsider. 
There's still time to evacuate!

00:04:55.260 --> 00:04:56.770
For the sake of our unborn child...

00:04:56.770 --> 00:04:59.360
Yeah, yeah. Here, a change of clothes.

00:05:01.330 --> 00:05:02.360
Elisa...

00:05:02.620 --> 00:05:05.610
There's no way we could run 
off and leave you here.

00:05:05.610 --> 00:05:10.190
If you're staying and fighting, 
I want to be here to support you.

00:05:11.570 --> 00:05:15.370
The others' families all feel the same way.

00:05:15.620 --> 00:05:16.810
But...

00:05:22.270 --> 00:05:23.840
Princess Yuki!

00:05:24.210 --> 00:05:26.180
Noel! What are you...

00:05:26.990 --> 00:05:28.530
Who are these people?

00:05:28.530 --> 00:05:30.490
It's been some time, Princess Yuki.

00:05:30.490 --> 00:05:32.760
I'm afraid we'll be imposing on you for a bit.

00:05:34.380 --> 00:05:37.830
Elisa, this discussion isn't over! Elisa!

00:05:37.830 --> 00:05:39.520
Princess Yuki! Where's Joshua?

00:05:41.180 --> 00:05:45.190
Hey, where's Joshua? I wanna play with him!

00:05:46.030 --> 00:05:50.450
Joshua... is far away right now. For work.

00:05:50.940 --> 00:05:52.200
Aw...

00:05:52.440 --> 00:05:55.120
Come on. Let's look at the flowers.

00:06:02.300 --> 00:06:03.710
So pretty!

00:06:04.120 --> 00:06:06.120
Huh? Are those flowers, too?

00:06:06.120 --> 00:06:07.720
They look all droopy....

00:06:07.720 --> 00:06:09.560
They're called sunflowers.

00:06:09.560 --> 00:06:12.060
They come from the our ancestors' homeworld,

00:06:12.060 --> 00:06:14.720
but they're very hard to grow...

00:06:15.340 --> 00:06:17.680
Let's water them! I'll go get some!

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:22.310
Noel!

00:06:24.370 --> 00:06:27.600
It's... It's dangerous here.

00:06:28.060 --> 00:06:30.610
I want you and your mother to go away.

00:06:32.030 --> 00:06:32.990
Please.

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:36.690
Why do we have to go away?

00:06:36.690 --> 00:06:39.500
We haven't done anything wrong.

00:06:40.880 --> 00:06:42.190
Well...

00:06:42.190 --> 00:06:43.550
C'mon, tell me!

00:06:43.550 --> 00:06:46.170
Princess Yuki, you're in charge 
of the whole country, right?

00:06:46.170 --> 00:06:48.010
I bet you know everything!

00:06:49.280 --> 00:06:53.390
No... I don't.

00:06:55.810 --> 00:06:58.930
<i>I'm like these flowers.</i>

00:06:59.410 --> 00:07:02.900
<i>Raised inside a cage, 
sheltered and cared for...</i>

00:07:03.220 --> 00:07:05.900
<i>That's why I didn't know...</i>

00:07:06.950 --> 00:07:08.310
<i>what was really going on...</i>

00:07:09.680 --> 00:07:10.460
<i>But...</i>

00:07:12.220 --> 00:07:14.820
I can't stay like this.

00:07:15.490 --> 00:07:16.910
Princess Yuki?

00:07:22.330 --> 00:07:24.220
The Kingdom's last line of defense

00:07:24.220 --> 00:07:27.580
will be 15 kilometers north of Hariant, 
on the Bram Plateau.

00:07:28.020 --> 00:07:30.950
We're down to 20% of our original forces.

00:07:31.310 --> 00:07:35.690
Only two platoons of theurgears 
equipped with the new chrars remain.

00:07:36.520 --> 00:07:38.180
What's their speed of approach?

00:07:38.940 --> 00:07:41.120
They're within 100 kilometers of Hariant.

00:07:41.120 --> 00:07:42.560
They'll reach our line around daybreak.

00:07:42.830 --> 00:07:46.770
They number 50,000 in total.

00:07:46.770 --> 00:07:49.570
And I'm sure Chief of Staff Aine Fleet
 is commanding them personally.

00:07:50.130 --> 00:07:52.230
Prepare one of the new chrars.

00:07:52.580 --> 00:07:53.910
I'm going to join the front lines.

00:07:54.600 --> 00:07:56.330
Harold, you...

00:07:56.640 --> 00:07:58.740
<i>The old ace going back into action, eh?</i>

00:07:58.740 --> 00:08:01.400
<i>That should boost the troops' morale.</i>

00:08:01.830 --> 00:08:03.870
<i>But are you sure you can handle it?</i>

00:08:04.180 --> 00:08:05.230
Of course I can.

00:08:05.650 --> 00:08:07.250
Who do you think you're talking to?

00:08:07.250 --> 00:08:08.980
<i>Heh... very well.</i>

00:08:08.980 --> 00:08:11.380
<i>I'll prepare you a Gard, then.</i>

00:08:21.340 --> 00:08:23.710
Your daughter is in Princess Yuki's room.

00:08:24.110 --> 00:08:26.360
You should take some time to rest, as well.

00:08:26.360 --> 00:08:29.200
All right. I think I shall.

00:08:31.940 --> 00:08:32.650
Elisa?

00:08:34.080 --> 00:08:35.110
Yes?

00:08:35.770 --> 00:08:38.490
Take care of your daughter.

00:08:38.490 --> 00:08:42.370
If there's anything that I can do, 
don't hesitate to let me know.

00:08:42.700 --> 00:08:44.400
I appreciate it greatly.

00:08:44.400 --> 00:08:47.320
Now, eat up, before it gets cold.

00:08:52.610 --> 00:08:56.650
Elisa prepared dinner for us. Shall we?

00:08:57.570 --> 00:08:58.390
Sure!

00:09:00.570 --> 00:09:02.300
Hey, Miss Layla.

00:09:02.800 --> 00:09:07.830
The Empire started the war because 
they wanted the new chrars, right?

00:09:08.160 --> 00:09:10.900
That is one of the reasons, yes.

00:09:11.320 --> 00:09:16.510
My parents were trying to make the 
new chrars to help everyone...

00:09:17.050 --> 00:09:19.360
I think they really meant it, too.

00:09:19.810 --> 00:09:20.780
But now...

00:09:23.030 --> 00:09:26.870
So many people have died 
because of the chrars.

00:09:27.610 --> 00:09:31.000
Why? Was it bad to make the chrars?

00:09:31.780 --> 00:09:33.890
One of the most basic causes of war

00:09:33.890 --> 00:09:36.980
is the struggle for wealth and resources.

00:09:37.480 --> 00:09:41.090
This time, it simply happens to be the chrars.

00:09:41.090 --> 00:09:42.180
But...

00:09:42.450 --> 00:09:46.080
The energy that the chrars provide is 
the foundation of our civilization.

00:09:46.600 --> 00:09:51.330
Their application would inevitably extend beyond
 peaceful purposes to weapons of war.

00:09:51.870 --> 00:09:53.050
Regrettable as it may be.

00:09:54.520 --> 00:09:55.440
Then...

00:09:56.650 --> 00:10:00.990
Then I'm going to use those 
weapons to stop the fighting.

00:10:01.510 --> 00:10:04.620
I'm tired of watching, silent and powerless!

00:10:06.580 --> 00:10:07.890
Princess Yuki...

00:10:11.820 --> 00:10:13.240
Did the princess...

00:10:13.240 --> 00:10:14.100
Yes.

00:10:14.540 --> 00:10:18.680
I hear she's visited Joshua's 
grave every day without fail.

00:10:27.990 --> 00:10:29.020
Adelle.

00:10:30.100 --> 00:10:31.320
I'm sorry.

00:10:33.350 --> 00:10:36.290
I'm going to give you reason 
to grieve once again.

00:10:37.930 --> 00:10:39.610
I'll ask, just to be sure.

00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:42.160
You aren't doing this just 
for revenge, are you?

00:10:47.140 --> 00:10:51.500
If the Empire hadn't resorted to 
force of arms twelve years ago...

00:11:05.020 --> 00:11:09.600
If you're just going back into 
battle to avenge her, then...

00:11:10.700 --> 00:11:12.220
I can't deny it.

00:11:12.220 --> 00:11:13.730
That is part of it.

00:11:14.720 --> 00:11:19.490
But my desire to protect Princess Yuki—
to protect the Kingdom—is genuine.

00:11:20.900 --> 00:11:21.810
Very well.

00:11:22.490 --> 00:11:23.520
Give it your best.

00:11:29.230 --> 00:11:31.120
Communication from the enemy Chief of Staff.

00:11:31.740 --> 00:11:33.460
<i>I'll ask you one more time:</i>

00:11:33.460 --> 00:11:35.150
<i>Advisor Langford,</i>

00:11:35.150 --> 00:11:37.100
<i>do you have no intent to surrender?</i>

00:11:37.830 --> 00:11:39.190
Certainly not.

00:11:39.190 --> 00:11:41.010
There is nothing more to discuss.

00:11:41.350 --> 00:11:43.510
<i>Very well. So noted.</i>

00:11:47.140 --> 00:11:50.900
<i>Sovereign of the Kingdom 
of Soleil, Princess Yuki.</i>

00:11:50.900 --> 00:11:54.440
<i>I am commander of the Imperial Army, 
Chief of Staff Aine Fleet.</i>

00:11:55.140 --> 00:11:56.310
A pleasure to meet you.

00:11:57.020 --> 00:12:00.080
<i>I'd heard you turned twelve years old, and...</i>

00:12:00.080 --> 00:12:02.420
<i>Indeed, you've grown quite pretty.</i>

00:12:02.420 --> 00:12:06.050
<i>You must have been raised in 
a truly loving environment.</i>

00:12:07.110 --> 00:12:09.260
<i>But that ends here today.</i>

00:12:09.260 --> 00:12:14.030
<i>Sit there in your ivory tower 
and watch your kingdom fall.</i>

00:12:14.920 --> 00:12:17.170
Here we go! Follow me!

00:12:17.170 --> 00:12:17.960
Yes, sir!

00:12:18.700 --> 00:12:20.640
That voice... was that Harold?

00:12:20.640 --> 00:12:21.590
Yes.

00:12:21.590 --> 00:12:23.800
He volunteered to lead the charge personally.

00:12:24.080 --> 00:12:28.220
I've never seen Harold fight 
in a theurgear before...

00:12:31.630 --> 00:12:33.350
Approximately 1,200 in their vanguard.

00:12:33.350 --> 00:12:34.710
Their main force is right behind.

00:12:34.710 --> 00:12:36.690
Total number... incalculable!

00:12:37.980 --> 00:12:39.610
There are two elements to our defense line.

00:12:42.700 --> 00:12:46.450
First, the front line minefield 
will winnow their numbers.

00:12:48.100 --> 00:12:49.720
Those that break through...

00:12:51.290 --> 00:12:54.040
will be met by Harold and 
the rest of the vanguard.

00:12:54.040 --> 00:12:55.790
Engage hand-to-hand combat!

00:13:10.150 --> 00:13:13.270
Those that break through will 
enter the rear minefield,

00:13:14.100 --> 00:13:16.190
where a firing squad will pick them off.

00:13:19.190 --> 00:13:20.270
Wait!

00:13:20.270 --> 00:13:23.570
Does that mean Harold and the others 
will be trapped between the minefields...

00:13:23.570 --> 00:13:25.660
Yes, and unable to retreat.

00:13:25.660 --> 00:13:28.070
It is a suicide mission.

00:13:32.420 --> 00:13:34.760
Half of the front line 
mines have been detonated.

00:13:34.760 --> 00:13:36.210
There are just too many of them!

00:13:36.540 --> 00:13:38.600
Adjust the range of our cannons.

00:13:38.600 --> 00:13:40.200
Angle of elevation, minus three degrees.

00:13:40.200 --> 00:13:41.840
Relay the same to the Krivanovs.

00:13:42.860 --> 00:13:45.840
But at that angle, we risk hitting our allies, too!

00:13:46.350 --> 00:13:48.720
They'll just have to be skilled 
enough not to get hit.

00:13:57.210 --> 00:13:58.230
It never ends!

00:14:01.060 --> 00:14:01.730
Yuni!

00:14:07.680 --> 00:14:09.140
Grand Master Harold!

00:14:09.140 --> 00:14:10.310
Keep each other safe,

00:14:10.310 --> 00:14:11.830
if you don't want any regrets.

00:14:15.690 --> 00:14:17.040
Here they come.

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:18.420
I won't let you people...

00:14:20.350 --> 00:14:22.080
take anything precious to me...

00:14:24.440 --> 00:14:26.970
ever again!

00:14:47.040 --> 00:14:49.100
You mustn't avert your gaze.

00:14:49.100 --> 00:14:50.740
This is our reality.

00:14:51.810 --> 00:14:54.230
You said that you wanted to 
stop the fighting, didn't you?

00:14:54.750 --> 00:14:57.080
Then think, with all your might...

00:14:57.080 --> 00:15:00.500
If you can't do that, 
you will remain powerless.

00:15:24.080 --> 00:15:25.480
You crafty little...!

00:15:39.030 --> 00:15:41.460
I admire your spirit, if nothing else.

00:15:44.130 --> 00:15:46.140
Harold, no!

00:15:48.030 --> 00:15:50.380
I admire your spirit, if nothing else.

00:15:52.100 --> 00:15:52.890
Damn you!

00:16:00.780 --> 00:16:03.770
That pilot went to help her comrade...

00:16:04.350 --> 00:16:06.410
The enemy are human, too.

00:16:06.410 --> 00:16:08.190
It's no surprise, is it?

00:16:14.640 --> 00:16:16.950
<i>This is wrong.</i>

00:16:17.600 --> 00:16:19.680
<i>But what can I...</i>

00:16:20.720 --> 00:16:22.120
Don't give up!

00:16:22.120 --> 00:16:25.080
With passion and will, 
there's nothing you can't do!

00:16:37.050 --> 00:16:38.300
It's possible...

00:16:39.230 --> 00:16:41.690
How many of the mines do we have left?

00:16:43.560 --> 00:16:45.900
20% on the front line. 50% in the rear.

00:16:46.710 --> 00:16:48.390
It just might work...

00:16:49.800 --> 00:16:52.330
Izana, do we have the 
data on the Bram Plateau?

00:16:55.160 --> 00:16:55.910
Yuni!

00:16:56.170 --> 00:16:58.660
It's all right... I'm not finished yet.

00:16:59.120 --> 00:17:00.310
Here I go!

00:17:01.790 --> 00:17:03.470
<i>Attention, all theurgears!</i>

00:17:03.470 --> 00:17:05.170
<i>I've disabled all the mines!</i>

00:17:05.660 --> 00:17:08.000
<i>Retreat to our camp behind the minefield!</i>

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:09.670
<i>This is an order from your princess!</i>

00:17:09.940 --> 00:17:12.170
Princess Yuki... What are you...

00:17:12.410 --> 00:17:14.130
<i>Notify the enemy army, too!</i>

00:17:14.130 --> 00:17:16.680
<i>Hurry! I don't want any 
more of them to die, either!</i>

00:17:28.380 --> 00:17:30.230
All mines... detonate!

00:17:37.360 --> 00:17:39.370
All units, fire!

00:17:58.330 --> 00:18:00.290
<i>Don't look away...</i>

00:18:00.290 --> 00:18:03.100
<i>These are the consequences of my actions.</i>

00:18:03.520 --> 00:18:06.280
The ground there is calcareous...

00:18:06.280 --> 00:18:09.730
It's been eroded away 
by an underground river.

00:18:10.550 --> 00:18:13.420
But I never even thought that you could...

00:18:15.260 --> 00:18:18.110
No way. It's so deep and so wide...

00:18:18.630 --> 00:18:20.490
We can't cross it with hovers...

00:18:22.500 --> 00:18:25.360
Excessarca, resume shelling!

00:18:25.360 --> 00:18:27.210
If we thin out their forces now—

00:18:27.210 --> 00:18:29.190
<i>No, you will not.</i>

00:18:29.190 --> 00:18:31.500
<i>I want you all to stand by 
and await my further command.</i>

00:18:31.810 --> 00:18:33.020
<i>Princess Yuki!</i>

00:18:33.020 --> 00:18:35.960
Harold, you need to do as I say.

00:18:35.960 --> 00:18:37.260
That's an order.

00:18:41.240 --> 00:18:42.530
Princess Yuki...

00:18:46.760 --> 00:18:50.950
It will probably take until tomorrow 
for the Empire to marshal their forces.

00:18:51.790 --> 00:18:54.200
What is our next course 
of action, Your Highness?

00:18:54.850 --> 00:18:57.890
Contact their leader, Chief of Staff Aine.

00:18:58.520 --> 00:19:01.760
The Kingdom of Soleil will accept 
the Empire's terms of surrender

00:19:01.760 --> 00:19:04.030
and lay down arms immediately.

00:19:04.770 --> 00:19:05.850
Princess Yuki!

00:19:05.850 --> 00:19:07.290
But, then...

00:19:07.770 --> 00:19:11.190
I don't want to see anyone else die.

00:19:11.190 --> 00:19:14.170
So I'll turn myself over to the Empire.

00:19:16.020 --> 00:19:20.680
I'm prepared to give my life 
to see an end to this fighting.

00:19:20.890 --> 00:19:22.210
No!

00:19:23.360 --> 00:19:24.380
Your Highness...

00:19:25.340 --> 00:19:27.140
You insist on this course of action?

00:19:28.540 --> 00:19:29.170
Yes.

00:19:30.700 --> 00:19:31.920
Very well.

00:19:32.250 --> 00:19:35.150
I'll begin overtures to the Empire at once.

00:19:36.420 --> 00:19:37.370
Thank you.

00:19:39.470 --> 00:19:43.160
The signing won't be at the 
Royal Palace of Soleil?

00:19:43.900 --> 00:19:46.920
You must travel to the Imperial headquarters.

00:19:46.920 --> 00:19:49.170
This ship will take you there.

00:19:49.170 --> 00:19:50.160
I see.

00:19:50.160 --> 00:19:51.640
Once the signing is complete,

00:19:51.640 --> 00:19:54.510
the Imperial Army will wish to 
begin their occupation immediately.

00:19:54.510 --> 00:19:57.160
I will remain and make preparations for that.

00:19:57.160 --> 00:19:58.420
Please do.

00:20:11.720 --> 00:20:13.070
Where are we going?

00:20:13.070 --> 00:20:15.460
This isn't the way to the 
Imperial headquarters...

00:20:15.460 --> 00:20:17.640
This ship is heading south

00:20:17.640 --> 00:20:19.850
to the primary refugee evacuation site,

00:20:19.850 --> 00:20:22.320
the southern State of Leo Tacrath.

00:20:23.160 --> 00:20:23.790
What?

00:20:25.740 --> 00:20:28.050
You will change our course this instant!

00:20:37.510 --> 00:20:38.580
Princess Yuki.

00:20:48.830 --> 00:20:50.370
<i>Good luck to all of you.</i>

00:20:50.710 --> 00:20:51.730
<i>Fight well.</i>

00:20:52.020 --> 00:20:54.730
Izana! I...

00:20:55.810 --> 00:20:58.540
<i>Look after Elisa and Noel...</i>

00:20:58.540 --> 00:21:02.290
<i>And my other child, about to be born.</i>

00:21:06.350 --> 00:21:10.170
<i>Princess Yuki, you have just 
begun to stand on your own.</i>

00:21:10.840 --> 00:21:13.000
<i>Now is not the time for you to die.</i>

00:21:16.060 --> 00:21:17.500
Izana!

00:22:51.280 --> 00:22:54.880
<i>To save her own skin, Yuki Soleil has fled.</i>

00:22:54.880 --> 00:22:58.510
<i>She has abandoned Hariant and its people!</i>

00:22:58.510 --> 00:22:59.520
<i>The sheer cowardice of it!</i>

00:23:00.060 --> 00:23:02.270
<i>She is unworthy to reign over others!</i>

00:23:02.810 --> 00:23:05.170
<i>We are victorious.</i>

00:23:05.170 --> 00:23:08.030
<i>The Kingdom is as good as fallen.</i>

00:23:08.720 --> 00:23:11.180
<i>And we owe it to your diligent, hard work.</i>

00:23:11.780 --> 00:23:14.700
<i>Glory to Grandiga!</i>

00:23:35.060 --> 00:23:40.280
<b><i>The Sunflowers of the Palace</i></b>
